k cup handles bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" aria-label="RIVA 90 image 6"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-01-riva-90-kum-beji-06.webp" alt="RIVA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Matt black cup handles bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="6" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-01-riva-90-kum-beji-07.webp" data-fit="cover" data-alt="RIVA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Matt black cup handles bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" aria-label="RIVA 90 image 7"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-01-riva-90-kum-beji-07.webp" alt="RIVA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Matt black cup handles bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="7" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-01-riva-90-kum-beji-08.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Matt black cup handles bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" aria-label="RIVA 90 image 8"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-01-riva-90-kum-beji-08.webp" alt="RIVA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Matt black cup handles bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Arched Alcove</span><span>EV–01</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">RIVA 90</a> <span>Arched Alcove · Compact Module</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige membrane MDF · Matt black cup handles</p><p class="ev-desc">A compact domestic coffee station featuring a vertically grooved arched alcove designed for British kitchen corners and dining niches. Equipped with contactless hand-wave daylight LED illumination, a soft-close accessory drawer, and an 18 mm full-MDF carcass to organise espresso machines and pouring equipment in one dedicated hub.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The Quiet Ritual of the Victorian Alcove: How RIVA 90 Reclaims the Compact British Kitchen Corner</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">In many British homes—from tall-ceilinged Victorian terraces in Clapham and red-brick Edwardian semis in Dulwich to converted Georgian flats in Edinburgh’s New Town—the chimney-breast recess has long been an awkward architectural afterthought. RIVA 90 was conceived specifically to turn that ninety-centimetre recess into the most magnetic square metre of the house.</p><p>Every morning begins long before the first sip of espresso. It begins with the tactile weight of a cold ceramic cup, the quiet hum of a burr grinder warming up, and the gentle pooling of warm light across a clean worktop. Yet in most British kitchens, coffee preparation is squeezed into a damp corner beside the kettle and toaster, competing for worktop space with chopping boards and draining racks. RIVA 90 resolves this domestic tension by establishing a self-contained, architectural coffee sanctuary within a compact 90 by 45 centimetre footprint. Rather than looking like an add-on cupboard, its vertically grooved fascia and classical arched preparation alcove echo the proportions of traditional British fireplace joinery and bespoke conservatory panelling.</p><p>Run your fingertips across the sand beige membrane surface and you immediately notice the absence of harsh synthetic gloss. The warm, chalky tone sits somewhere between Cotswold limestone and unbleached linen, absorbing harsh morning glare whilst reflecting a soft, inviting warmth under evening lighting. When you step towards the station at dawn, there is no need to fumble for a wall switch with wet hands: a simple pass of your hand beneath the arched pelmet triggers the contactless hand-wave sensor, bathing the vertically fluted back panel and 43-centimetre-deep preparation deck in balanced daylight LED illumination. Steam rising from a dual-boiler espresso machine or a gooseneck pour-over kettle catches that light against the shadow lines of the vertical grooves, turning a routine two-minute brew into a moment of genuine domestic theatre.</p><p>Beneath the serene exterior lies uncompromising structural engineering. Where mass-market flat-pack furniture relies on low-density particleboard that swells at the first hint of steam or spilled water, RIVA 90 is constructed entirely from 18-millimetre Grade-A high-density MDF across both carcass and doors. Above the arch, a concealed double-door top cupboard stores spare kilogram bags of single-origin beans, paper filters, and tall cafetières out of sight. Below the worktop, a full-width drawer glides on damped telescopic steel runners—weighted to hold heavy stainless-steel tampers, knock boxes, distribution tools, and tea caddies without a whisper of rattle—whilst the twin lower doors open to reveal deep larder shelving for oat milk cartons, sparkling water cases, and weekend stoneware. Finished with tactile matt black cup handles that nod to nineteenth-century scullery ironmongery, RIVA 90 brings architectural order and warm hospitality to even the most compact British room.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Purpose-built 90 × 45 × 205 cm footprint tailored for British Victorian and Edwardian chimney-breast alcoves, compact kitchen-diners, and study corners.</li><li>Signature vertically fluted arched alcove with contactless hand-wave daylight LED task lighting and 43 cm clear worktop depth for domestic espresso machines.</li><li>100% 18 mm Grade-A full-MDF carcass and membrane-wrapped doors—zero chipboard—paired with soft-close hinges, telescopic drawer runners, and matt black cup handles.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated RIVA 90 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>18 mm Full MDF</li><li>Hand-Wave Sensor LED</li><li>Soft-Close Drawer</li><li>Arched Alcove</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>90 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">43 cm net worktop depth · Contactless hand-wave daylight LED</p><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-0">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-0" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-01">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
