"8" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-02-riva-130-sol-kum-beji-09.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Left vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" aria-label="RIVA 130 LEFT image 9"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-02-riva-130-sol-kum-beji-09.webp" alt="RIVA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Left vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="9" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-02-riva-130-sol-kum-beji-10.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Left vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" aria-label="RIVA 130 LEFT image 10"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-02-riva-130-sol-kum-beji-10.webp" alt="RIVA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Left vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="10" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-02-riva-130-sol-kum-beji-11.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Left vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" aria-label="RIVA 130 LEFT image 11"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-02-riva-130-sol-kum-beji-11.webp" alt="RIVA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Left vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Left Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–02</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-130-left-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">RIVA 130 LEFT</a> <span>Left Glazed Vitrine · Arched Alcove</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige membrane MDF · Left vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves</p><p class="ev-desc">Combines a full-height 40 cm left-hand glazed display tower with a vertically grooved arched preparation alcove, showcasing porcelain and glassware across illuminated 6 mm tempered glass shelves. Its modular tower construction can also be positioned as a standalone display cabinet.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Asymmetry with Purpose: RIVA 130 LEFT and the Art of the Illuminated Glass Vitrine</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Not every room wants symmetry. Where an open-plan kitchen flows into a dining area or a glazed garden extension, an asymmetrical composition often feels far more natural—anchoring the eye on one side whilst leaving the adjacent worktop open and approachable. RIVA 130 LEFT was designed for precisely that architectural transition.</p><p>Picture a sunlit kitchen-diner in Southwest London or a refurbished barn conversion in Oxfordshire where the dining table sits a few paces from the main cooking zone. Guests naturally gravitate towards the coffee machine after dinner, yet nobody wants to crowd around the sink while espresso is being pulled. Measuring 130 centimetres wide by 205 centimetres high, RIVA 130 LEFT bridges the gap between functional barista workbench and formal dining room vitrine. On the right-hand side sits the signature 90-centimetre arched preparation bay, framed by fine vertical fluting in warm sand beige; on the left stands a full-height, 40-centimetre glazed display column that rises uninterrupted from plinth to cornice.</p><p>The placement of the vitrine on the left wing is a deliberate piece of spatial choreography. When positioned against a wall where traffic approaches from the right, the open arched worktop greets the hand first, giving your right arm unrestricted elbow room to steam milk, tamp portafilters, or pour from a kettle without brushing against a cabinet side panel. Meanwhile, the left-hand glazed tower acts as a vertical lantern. Behind its full-length framed glass door, four compartments divided by 6-millimetre polished-edge tempered glass shelves showcase your finest handmade espresso cups, crystal tumblers, decanters, and ceramic drippers. When the contactless hand-wave sensor is activated, warm LED light filters through the glass shelves and across the fluted arch simultaneously, casting a soft architectural glow across the entire dining space long after the main ceiling lights have been dimmed.</p><p>What makes RIVA 130 LEFT remarkably adaptable for British homeowners is its split modular carcass construction. The 90-centimetre central barista station and the 40-centimetre left vitrine tower are engineered as precision-mated 18-millimetre full-MDF modules. Installed together, they form a seamless 130-centimetre architectural suite; should you ever reconfigure your dining room or move house, the glazed tower can be uncoupled and positioned as an independent porcelain display cabinet on an adjacent wall. With a full-width damped accessory drawer, deep lower larder cupboards, and moisture-resistant membrane surfaces in soothing sand beige, RIVA 130 LEFT transforms everyday coffee service into an effortless host’s ritual.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>130 × 45 × 205 cm asymmetrical left-vitrine suite combining a 90 cm arched barista station with a detachable 40 cm full-height glazed display tower.</li><li>Left-hand vitrine fitted with 6 mm tempered glass shelves and integrated LED illumination to display porcelain, crystal glassware, and speciality brewing gear.</li><li>Right-side open alcove geometry provides generous right-handed barista elbow clearance, supported by 18 mm full-MDF construction and soft-close ironmongery.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-130-left-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated RIVA 130 LEFT Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Left Glazed Vitrine</li><li>Detachable Tower</li><li>Hand-Wave Sensor LED</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>130 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">90 cm central station + 40 cm detachable left glazed vitrine</p><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-130-left-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-1">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-1" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-02">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
