<button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="8" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-03-riva-130-sag-kum-beji-09.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Right vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" aria-label="RIVA 130 RIGHT image 9"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-03-riva-130-sag-kum-beji-09.webp" alt="RIVA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Right vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="9" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-03-riva-130-sag-kum-beji-10.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Right vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" aria-label="RIVA 130 RIGHT image 10"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-03-riva-130-sag-kum-beji-10.webp" alt="RIVA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Right vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="10" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-03-riva-130-sag-kum-beji-11.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Right vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" aria-label="RIVA 130 RIGHT image 11"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-03-riva-130-sag-kum-beji-11.webp" alt="RIVA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Right vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Right Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–03</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-130-right-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">RIVA 130 RIGHT</a> <span>Right Glazed Vitrine · Arched Alcove</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige membrane MDF · Right vitrine with 6 mm glass shelves</p><p class="ev-desc">Tailored for room layouts requiring right-hand door swing clearance, uniting an illuminated full-height glazed display tower on the right wing with an arched preparation worktop. Conceals coffee pods, filters, and dry provisions within a soft-close telescopic drawer and twin base cupboard.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Tailored for Right-Hand Clearances: The Spatial Intelligence of RIVA 130 RIGHT</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Anyone who has ever planned a British kitchen knows that door swings, radiator valves, and patio casements dictate what can live on a wall. RIVA 130 RIGHT mirrors our asymmetric arched suite so that rooms with left-hand doorways or right-hand corner returns enjoy effortless flow without compromising on display volume.</p><p>In architectural joinery, handedness is everything. Place a tall display tower on the wrong side of an entrance doorway and you immediately narrow the sightline upon entering the room, creating an awkward tunnel effect and risking a collision between the room door and a glass cabinet front. RIVA 130 RIGHT places its open, vertically grooved 90-centimetre arched preparation bay on the left and anchors the full-height 40-centimetre glazed vitrine tower on the right. When installed just inside a dining room entrance or alongside a hallway threshold, the lower visual mass of the open arched worktop keeps the entry sightline airy and welcoming, whilst the tall illuminated vitrine settles naturally into the deeper corner of the wall.</p><p>The sensory experience of RIVA 130 RIGHT is rooted in calm, tactile materials. Its sand beige membrane finish—applied under high pressure and heat over 18-millimetre Grade-A MDF—has a velvety, low-sheen warmth that pairs effortlessly with herringboned oak parquet, limestone flags, or contemporary micro-cement floors. Wave your hand beneath the upper arch and the contactless sensor brings the station to life: daylight LED illumination washes down the finely ribbed back panel, highlighting the chrome group-head of your espresso machine and glinting off the glassware arranged across the 6-millimetre tempered glass shelves inside the right-hand vitrine. Every detail has been considered to keep visual clutter at bay, from the concealed upper cupboard above the arch to the crisp shadow lines around the shaker-inspired lower doors.</p><p>In daily use, the ergonomics prove quietly addictive. Your coffee beans, digital scales, and V60 filters live at eye level behind the right-hand glass door or tucked inside the upper overhead pelmet cupboard; your tampers, dosing funnels, microfibre cloths, and teaspoons sit neatly inside the central soft-close telescopic drawer right beneath the machine; and bulk supplies—from oat milk and syrup bottles to spare roasting tins and table linens—disappear into the twin-door base cabinet. Because both the 90-centimetre station and the 40-centimetre right tower are fabricated from solid 18-millimetre full MDF rather than hollow honeycomb board, the doors close with a reassuringly muted thud that speaks of permanence and proper cabinetmaking.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Right-handed 130 × 45 × 205 cm architectural layout designed for walls where doorways or circulation paths approach from the left-hand side.</li><li>40 cm full-height right glazed vitrine with 6 mm tempered glass shelving and contactless hand-wave daylight LED illumination across the arched alcove.</li><li>18 mm Grade-A full-MDF carcass and membrane fascia in warm sand beige with matt black cup handles and full-extension damped drawer runners.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-130-right-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated RIVA 130 RIGHT Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Right Glazed Vitrine</li><li>Detachable Tower</li><li>Hand-Wave Sensor LED</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>130 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">90 cm central station + 40 cm detachable right glazed vitrine</p><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-130-right-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-2">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-2" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-03">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
