09.webp" alt="RIVA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Twin full-height glazed vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="9" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-04-riva-170-kum-beji-10.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Twin full-height glazed vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" aria-label="RIVA 170 image 10"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-04-riva-170-kum-beji-10.webp" alt="RIVA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Twin full-height glazed vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="10" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-04-riva-170-kum-beji-11.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="RIVA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Twin full-height glazed vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" aria-label="RIVA 170 image 11"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-04-riva-170-kum-beji-11.webp" alt="RIVA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige membrane MDF · Twin full-height glazed vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" width="1280" height="1170" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Twin Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–04</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-170-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">RIVA 170</a> <span>Twin Glazed Vitrine · Arched Alcove</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige membrane MDF · Twin full-height glazed vitrines</p><p class="ev-desc">Establishes an architectural focal point in open-plan British kitchens and dining rooms with an arched hospitality alcove flanked by symmetrical left and right glazed display towers. Built with 6 mm tempered glass shelves, contactless hand-wave daylight LED lighting, and an 18 mm full-MDF carcass.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The Grand Georgian Credenza Reimagined: RIVA 170 Twin-Vitrine Hospitality Suite</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">There is an unmistakable sense of calm that classical symmetry brings to a large room. Spanning a full 170 centimetres in width, RIVA 170 takes its cue from the great eighteenth-century British breakfront dressers and dining room credenzas, reinterpreting them for contemporary home coffee and evening aperitif culture.</p><p>Walk into an open-plan kitchen-living room in a converted Surrey coach house or a wide lateral apartment in Kensington, and a small cabinet against a four-metre wall can easily look lost. Large rooms demand architectural weight and classical proportion. RIVA 170 delivers that presence through a balanced 40 + 90 + 40 centimetre triptych: a central vertically grooved arched barista alcove flanked on both left and right by identical floor-to-ceiling glazed display towers. The silhouette immediately anchors a dining wall, creating a dedicated destination for morning flat whites, afternoon Darjeeling service, and late-evening digestifs without requiring a costly structural builders’ alcove.</p><p>The interplay of light and texture across this 170-centimetre expanse is extraordinarily rich. During daylight hours, the sand beige membrane finish reads as a tranquil, stone-inspired neutral that softens hard plaster walls; by dusk, a single gesture beneath the contactless hand-wave sensor transforms the entire piece into a warm architectural beacon. Light spills downward across the ribbed central arch whilst the twin glazed towers—each fitted with 6-millimetre tempered glass shelves—illuminate your collection of porcelain demitasse cups, coupe glasses, ceramic canisters, and art books from both sides. Because the twin 40-centimetre towers are engineered as independent modular columns coupled to the 90-centimetre centrepiece, the cabinet possesses true breakfront depth and structural rigidity.</p><p>Storage capacity inside RIVA 170 rivals that of a fitted butler’s pantry. Across the suite, you command two full-height glazed display vitrines, two enclosed lower side cupboards, a concealed double-door overhead storage bay above the arch, a wide soft-close telescopic accessory drawer, and a double-door central base larder. That means every single piece of hospitality equipment in your household—from a twin-boiler espresso machine, precision grinder, and milk frother on the 43-centimetre-deep central deck to forty guests’ worth of glassware, table napkins, coffee pods, and reserve bottles below—lives in one coherent, dust-free sanctuary crafted from 18-millimetre Grade-A full MDF.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Commanding 170 × 45 × 205 cm symmetrical three-module breakfront suite (40 cm left vitrine + 90 cm arched station + 40 cm right vitrine).</li><li>Twin full-height glazed display towers with 6 mm tempered glass shelves and contactless hand-wave daylight LED lighting across the grooved arch.</li><li>Pantry-grade storage capacity in 18 mm full-MDF construction with sand beige membrane finish, matt black cup ironmongery, and soft-close hardware.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-170-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated RIVA 170 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Twin Glazed Vitrine</li><li>Symmetrical 170 cm</li><li>Hand-Wave Sensor LED</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>170 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">40 + 90 + 40 cm symmetrical three-module architectural suite</p><a href="/coffee-corners/riva-170-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-3">Qty</label><inp