Glazed Vitrine · Matt Black Hardware</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white full MDF · Contrast matt black metal handles</p><p class="ev-desc">A high-capacity 170 cm coffee credenza pairing a crisp matt white full-MDF carcass with contrasting black metal ironmongery and a central arched preparation bay. Twin glazed side towers and motion-activated LED lighting provide both illuminated glass display and concealed larder storage.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Monochrome Precision: ARCO NERO 170 and the Graphic Contrast of Matt White &amp; Black Ironmongery</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">For interiors defined by crisp architectural plasterwork, Crittall-style steel glazing, and monochromatic stone worktops, warm beige is not always the answer. ARCO NERO 170 translates our grand twin-vitrine arched silhouette into a gallery-crisp matt white full-MDF composition punctuated by bold matt black metal ironmongery.</p><p>Contemporary British kitchen design has developed a lasting affection for the pairing of chalk-white joinery and matt black architectural steel—think of a rear glazed extension in Islington or a minimalist townhouse in Manchester where black-framed bi-fold doors look out onto a slate terrace. ARCO NERO 170 was created to sit effortlessly within these high-contrast spaces. At 170 centimetres wide and 205 centimetres tall, it commands the room with classical twin-tower symmetry, yet its pure matt white membrane surface and vertically grooved arched back panel keep the visual weight remarkably light and crisp. Instead of absorbing light, the white full-MDF fascia reflects natural daylight deep into the room, making even north-facing British dining spaces feel noticeably brighter.</p><p>What gives ARCO NERO 170 its distinctive character is the disciplined graphic punctuation of its matt black hardware. Every drawer pull and cupboard handle is cast in satin-black metal, drawing a sharp horizontal and vertical rhythm across the white shaker-profiled doors that speaks directly to black window mullions, dark granite worktops, and matt black espresso machines. Step up to the 90-centimetre central preparation bay—offering a generous 56 centimetres of vertical clearance beneath the arch and 43 centimetres of net worktop depth—and wave your hand past the contactless motion sensor. Instantly, concealed daylight LEDs trace the vertical fluting of the white alcove and illuminate the 6-millimetre tempered glass shelves inside both flanking 40-centimetre vitrine towers.</p><p>From a practical standpoint, ARCO NERO 170 is built to withstand the rigours of busy family life. Every carcass panel, shelf, drawer front, and moulded door is precision-machined from 18-millimetre Grade-A MDF and sealed in a durable, wipe-clean matt white membrane that resists espresso splatters, steam, and fingerprints. The central full-width drawer runs on heavy-duty soft-close telescopic slides, keeping portafilters, coffee scoops, and linen coasters neatly marshalled, whilst the four lower cupboard doors and twin overhead arch doors conceal everything from bulk coffee beans and breakfast cereals to large serving platters.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>170 × 45 × 205 cm twin-vitrine arched hospitality credenza in crisp matt white 18 mm full MDF with contrasting matt black metal handles.</li><li>56 cm vertical alcove clearance and 43 cm net worktop depth with contactless hand-wave daylight LED lighting and vertically fluted splashback.</li><li>Symmetrical 40 + 90 + 40 cm modular construction with 6 mm tempered glass display shelves, soft-close telescopic drawer, and four lower cupboards.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/arco-nero-170-white/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated ARCO NERO 170 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Twin Glazed Vitrine</li><li>Hand-Wave Sensor LED</li><li>Black Metal Hardware</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>170 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">43 cm net worktop depth · 56 cm preparation alcove height</p><a href="/coffee-corners/arco-nero-170-white/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-4">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-4" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-05">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
