MDF home coffee corner — view 13" aria-label="PURA 170 image 13"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-07-pura-170-kulpsuz-beyaz-13.webp" alt="PURA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="13" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-07-pura-170-kulpsuz-beyaz-14.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="PURA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 14" aria-label="PURA 170 image 14"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-07-pura-170-kulpsuz-beyaz-14.webp" alt="PURA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 14" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Matt White MDF · Twin Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–07</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/pura-170-handleless-white/" class="ev-card-title-link">PURA 170</a> <span>Handleless Minimalist · Twin Half-Vitrine</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass</p><p class="ev-desc">Designed for contemporary handleless kitchens with clean flush door lines, black-framed smoked glass upper cabinets, and enclosed lower larder cupboards. Its generous 65 cm high preparation bay easily accommodates bean-to-cup espresso machines and commercial-grade grinders.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Architectural Minimalism &amp; Smoked Glass Mystery: The Handleless Geometry of PURA 170</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">For lovers of contemporary handleless kitchens—where every line is flush, every shadow gap is deliberate, and ornament is stripped back to pure form and light—traditional cup handles and classical arches can feel too ornate. PURA 170 is our modernist answer: a 170-centimetre handleless monolith with black-framed smoked glass vitrines.</p><p>In a modern British architectural kitchen—whether an ultra-clean handleless island suite in a glass-walled Surrey residence or a warehouse conversion in Shoreditch—visual serenity depends on uninterrupted planar geometry. PURA 170 eliminates protruding handles altogether, presenting a flush, monolithic matt white 18-millimetre full-MDF facade split by crisp dark shadow lines and four black-framed smoked glass upper doors. Measuring 170 centimetres wide by 205 centimetres high, it replaces the classical curved arch with a bold, rectilinear barista aperture that aligns millimetre-for-millimetre with contemporary European kitchen cabinetry and integrated appliance banks.</p><p>The magic of PURA 170 lies in the dialogue between its matt white carcass and its tinted smoked glass vitrines. When the internal LED illumination is switched off during the day, the black-framed smoked glass upper doors—spanning both the central overhead cabinet and the upper halves of the twin 40-centimetre side towers—present a sleek, reflective dark surface that conceals visual clutter. Touch the lighting sensor, however, and the smoked glass turns translucent, revealing the silhouettes of your glassware, espresso cups, and decanters bathed in a warm, lounge-like amber glow. Beneath the upper smoked-glass bridge, the central preparation bay offers an exceptionally tall 65-centimetre vertical clearance and 86 centimetres of internal width, easily accommodating tall commercial-style bean-to-cup machines, dual-hopper grinders, and sparkling water dispensers.</p><p>Every cupboard and drawer on PURA 170 operates via clean, ergonomic finger-pull channels and damped soft-close European hardware, preserving the pure planar front. Because the lower halves of the twin 40-centimetre side towers and the central 90-centimetre base unit are fitted with solid matt white 18-millimetre MDF doors, heavy or unsightly items remain completely hidden from view while your finest pieces float in the illuminated smoked-glass gallery above. Moreover, the twin 40-centimetre side columns are fully detachable, allowing you to install PURA 170 as a single 170-centimetre statement wall or flank a wide doorway with symmetrical standalone towers.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>170 × 45 × 205 cm contemporary handleless coffee &amp; beverage wall in matt white 18 mm full MDF with black-framed smoked glass upper vitrines.</li><li>Extra-tall 65 cm vertical machine bay clearance (86 × 43 cm net worktop) designed for tall bean-to-cup espresso machines and professional grinders.</li><li>Detachable 40 cm left and right half-vitrine towers, integrated LED glass cabinet lighting, soft-close full-width drawer, and flush handleless doors.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/pura-170-handleless-white/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated PURA 170 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Handleless Profile</li><li>Smoked Glass Vitrine</li><li>LED Illumination</li><li>Detachable Towers</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>170 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">65 cm upper alcove clearance · Detachable 40 cm side towers</p><a href="/coffee-corners/pura-170-handleless-white/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-6">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-6" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-07">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
