offee corner — view 6" aria-label="CLARO 90 image 6"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-06.webp" alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="6" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-07.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" aria-label="CLARO 90 image 7"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-07.webp" alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="7" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-08.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" aria-label="CLARO 90 image 8"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-08.webp" alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="8" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-09.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" aria-label="CLARO 90 image 9"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-09.webp" alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="9" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-10.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" aria-label="CLARO 90 image 10"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-08-claro-90-beyaz-10.webp" alt="CLARO 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Matt White MDF · Compact Single Module</span><span>EV–08</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-90-white/" class="ev-card-title-link">CLARO 90</a> <span>Smoked Upper Vitrine · Compact Module</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass</p><p class="ev-desc">Maximises storage efficiency within a 90 cm wall footprint. The LED-illuminated black-framed smoked glass upper cabinet displays espresso cups and glassware, whilst the wide central soft-close drawer and double lower cupboard house all brewing essentials.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Big-Architecture Presence in a 90 cm Footprint: CLARO 90 with Smoked Glass Upper Vitrine</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">You should not need a sprawling country dining room to enjoy the atmospheric glow of smoked glass and architectural LED lighting. CLARO 90 distils the sleek handleless modernism of our smoked-glass collection into a super-efficient 90-centimetre single module built for urban British apartments and compact kitchens.</p><p>Space in a London flat, a Brighton Regency conversion, or a modern townhouse kitchen is precious, yet compact rooms actually benefit the most from vertical architectural joinery. When small appliances—espresso machine, grinder, milk frother, kettle—are scattered across a main kitchen counter, a compact kitchen immediately feels crowded. CLARO 90 gathers that entire daily ritual into a single, disciplined 90 by 45 centimetre floor footprint while rising 205 centimetres to make full use of vertical wall height. Its crisp matt white 18-millimetre full-MDF sides frame a strikingly modern composition: a twin-door black-framed smoked glass vitrine at eye level, a tall 65-centimetre preparation alcove in the centre, and a handleless drawer-and-cupboard base below.</p><p>The black-framed smoked glass upper cabinet is what elevates CLARO 90 far above an ordinary kitchen larder. Rather than hiding your favourite ceramics behind solid doors or exposing them to cooking grease on open shelves, the tinted tempered glass filters the internal LED light into a rich, atmospheric glow. Through the dark glass, stacked porcelain espresso cups, V60 carafes, and speciality coffee tins remain visible as curated silhouettes while staying completely protected from dust. Directly beneath this illuminated vitrine, the 86-centimetre-wide by 43-centimetre-deep worktop gives you an uncluttered, wipe-clean stage with a generous 65 centimetres of headroom—tall enough to lift the water tank or fill the bean hopper of any domestic coffee machine without pulling the appliance forward.</p><p>Engineered from 100% 18-millimetre Grade-A MDF across both carcass and fronts, CLARO 90 has the dense, solid feel of fitted architectural joinery. The wide central drawer runs on smooth, damped telescopic runners with a clean handleless finger-pull channel, keeping coffee pods, tampers, filters, and teaspoons organised right below the worktop. Beneath the drawer, twin flush matt white doors open to reveal a deep two-tier base cupboard capable of storing cases of milk, syrups, breakfast bowls, and bulk dry provisions. It is proof that ninety centimetres of wall space is all it takes to bring a boutique espresso bar home.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Compact 90 × 45 × 205 cm single-module coffee station combining matt white 18 mm full MDF with an LED-lit black-framed smoked glass upper cabinet.</li><li>Generous 86 × 43 cm net machine deck with 65 cm vertical clearance—allowing top-loading bean hoppers and water reservoirs to be refilled in situ.</li><li>Handleless minimalist profile with damped telescopic full-width accessory drawer and double-door concealed lower storage cupboard.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-90-white/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated CLARO 90 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>90 cm Compact</li><li>Smoked Glass Cabinet</li><li>LED Illumination</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>90 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">86 × 43 cm net machine bay · 65 cm alcove clearance</p><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-90-white/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-7">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-7" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-08">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
