w 12" aria-label="CLARO 130 RIGHT image 12"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-10-claro-130-sag-beyaz-12.webp" alt="CLARO 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Right full-height black smoked vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 12" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Matt White MDF · Right Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–10</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-130-right-white/" class="ev-card-title-link">CLARO 130 RIGHT</a> <span>Right Full-Height Smoked Vitrine</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white full MDF · Right full-height black smoked vitrine</p><p class="ev-desc">Pairs a 205 cm tall right-hand smoked glass display tower with an 86 cm clear preparation worktop, offering balanced glassware display and concealed larder storage for medium-sized British kitchens and dining rooms.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Balanced Modernism for Left-Entry Rooms: CLARO 130 RIGHT Full-Height Smoked Vitrine Suite</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">When your kitchen island or dining doorway sits to the left of your feature wall, placing the open preparation bay on the left and the full-height smoked glass tower on the right creates an immediate, frictionless connection between host and guests. That is the exact brief behind CLARO 130 RIGHT.</p><p>Great domestic architecture is never just about how a cabinet looks in isolation; it is about how it interacts with the room’s natural walking paths. CLARO 130 RIGHT positions its 90-centimetre handleless matt white barista worktop on the left wing—closest to the main kitchen workflow or doorway—and anchors the composition on the right with a dramatic, floor-to-ceiling 40-centimetre black-framed smoked glass display tower. As you step towards the unit from the kitchen or dining table, the open 86 by 43 centimetre preparation deck is immediately at hand, while the 205-centimetre tall smoked glass column provides a vertical architectural bookend against the far corner of the wall.</p><p>Visually, the interplay between crisp matt white 18-millimetre MDF and deep black-framed smoked glass gives CLARO 130 RIGHT an unmistakable penthouse character. The upper double cabinet above the espresso machine and the full-height right-hand tower form an inverted L of illuminated dark glass. Switch on the integrated warm LED lighting and five full levels of shelving inside the right tower—plus the two-door upper bridge above the worktop—come alive with a warm, amber-tinted radiance. Whether you fill those shelves with handmade Japanese pour-over ceramics, Riedel wine glasses, single-malt decanters, or speciality coffee canisters, the smoked glass lends everything inside a sense of quiet curation while shielding your collection from dust and kitchen vapour.</p><p>Beneath the 65-centimetre-high preparation bay, a full-width handleless drawer glides silently on soft-close telescopic steel runners, offering instant access to tampers, dosing scales, filters, and capsules. Below that, a double-door matt white cupboard conceals bulk provisions, milk cartons, and cleaning gear behind solid 18-millimetre full-MDF doors. And because the 90-centimetre barista module and the 40-centimetre full-height right vitrine are engineered as self-contained units, they can be locked together as a seamless 130-centimetre credenza or positioned independently to suit changing British room layouts.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>130 × 45 × 205 cm right-vitrine architectural layout pairing a 90 cm handleless matt white barista station with a 40 cm floor-to-ceiling smoked glass tower.</li><li>Five-tier LED-illuminated smoked glass display column on the right wing plus a twin-door smoked glass bridge cabinet above the 65 cm tall worktop bay.</li><li>100% 18 mm Grade-A full-MDF construction with damped telescopic drawer slides, soft-close hinges, and modular separable tower flexibility.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-130-right-white/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated CLARO 130 RIGHT Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Right Full Vitrine</li><li>Smoked Glass</li><li>LED Illumination</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>130 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">90 cm preparation station + 40 cm right full-height smoked vitrine</p><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-130-right-white/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-9">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-9" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-10">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
