-thumb" data-idx="12" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-11-claro-170-beyaz-13.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="CLARO 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Twin full-height black smoked vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" aria-label="CLARO 170 image 13"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-11-claro-170-beyaz-13.webp" alt="CLARO 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Matt white full MDF · Twin full-height black smoked vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Matt White MDF · Twin Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–11</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-170-white/" class="ev-card-title-link">CLARO 170</a> <span>Twin Full-Height Smoked Vitrine</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white full MDF · Twin full-height black smoked vitrines</p><p class="ev-desc">Establishes a gallery-grade home coffee &amp; beverage bar in spacious kitchens and living areas, combining twin full-height LED-lit smoked glass vitrine towers with a wide central barista preparation station.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The Penthouse Barista Wall: CLARO 170 with Twin Floor-to-Ceiling Smoked Glass Towers</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">If a home coffee and beverage station can be called a piece of contemporary theatre, CLARO 170 is the main stage. Flanking an 86-centimetre handleless matt white preparation bay with twin floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass towers, it transforms a 170-centimetre wall into an illuminated architectural gallery.</p><p>Imagine the focal wall of a large open-plan kitchen-living room in a contemporary British home—perhaps overlooking a landscaped garden through black aluminium sliding doors, or anchoring the dining zone of a lateral city apartment. In such a space, you want a piece of joinery that transitions effortlessly from a high-performance morning espresso bar to an atmospheric evening cocktail and wine display. Spanning 170 centimetres in width and rising 205 centimetres in height, CLARO 170 achieves this duality with breathtaking composure. Two floor-to-ceiling 40-centimetre black-framed smoked glass vitrine towers stand sentinel on either side, bridged across the top by a matching double-door smoked glass cabinet that frames the crisp matt white barista station at the centre.</p><p>When the integrated warm LED lighting is switched on, CLARO 170 creates a continuous portal of light around the central machine bay. Ten full shelf compartments across the left and right towers, together with the twin-door overhead vitrine, glow through the dark tinted tempered glass—displaying everything from espresso porcelain, chemex carafes, and matcha bowls to crystal coupes, decanters, and art objects. Meanwhile, the central worktop alcove—offering 86 centimetres of width, 43 centimetres of net depth, and a generous 65 centimetres of vertical clearance—frames your espresso machine and burr grinder like a piece of industrial sculpture against the clean matt white 18-millimetre MDF back panel.</p><p>Despite its gallery-grade elegance, CLARO 170 is engineered for serious daily utility. Below the central worktop, a wide handleless drawer on damped telescopic runners keeps all barista tools, pods, napkins, and scales organised at waist height, while the twin solid matt white lower doors conceal bulky bags of beans, spare milk cartons, and large appliances out of sight. Fabricated entirely from 18-millimetre Grade-A full MDF for rock-solid longevity, its three modular columns (40 + 90 + 40 cm) can be installed as one commanding 170-centimetre architectural breakfront or arranged separately across a room.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Flagship 170 × 45 × 205 cm twin-tower modernist coffee &amp; beverage wall with floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass vitrines on both wings.</li><li>Continuous LED-illuminated smoked glass surround (10 tower compartments + upper bridge cabinet) framing an 86 × 43 × 65 cm central barista bay.</li><li>18 mm Grade-A full-MDF handleless construction in matt white with damped telescopic drawer, concealed base larder, and modular 40+90+40 cm design.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-170-white/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated CLARO 170 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Twin Full Vitrine</li><li>Smoked Glass</li><li>LED Illumination</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>170 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">40 + 90 + 40 cm full-height glazed architectural composition</p><a href="/coffee-corners/claro-170-white/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-10">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-10" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-11">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
