dth="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="9" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-10.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="DUNA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" aria-label="DUNA 90 image 10"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-10.webp" alt="DUNA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="10" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-11.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="DUNA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" aria-label="DUNA 90 image 11"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-11.webp" alt="DUNA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Compact Single Module</span><span>EV–12</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/duna-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">DUNA 90</a> <span>Sand Beige · Compact Smoked Vitrine</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige full MDF · Black smoked glass upper vitrine</p><p class="ev-desc">Unites a warm sand beige MDF finish with a black-framed smoked glass upper cabinet and ambient LED lighting in a compact 90 cm footprint. Fitted with hydraulic soft-close hinges and a telescopic damped drawer for quiet everyday use.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Sculpted Half-Vitrine Harmony: VELA 130 LEFT for Poised Everyday Living</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">While full-height glass towers love to show everything off, many British households prefer an equal balance between illuminated glass display at eye level and concealed, solid-door larder storage below. VELA 130 LEFT strikes that exact 50/50 architectural equilibrium.</p><p>Consider how a real family kitchen or dining room operates over the course of a week. At eye level, you want the pleasure of seeing your finest ceramics, glassware, and coffee canisters glowing behind tinted glass; below waist level, however, you almost certainly have items—multipacks of oat milk, bags of dog treats, spare kitchen rolls, children’s breakfast cereals, or heavy cast-iron cookware—that have no business being visible through a floor-length glass door. VELA 130 LEFT solves this with effortless poise. Measuring 130 centimetres wide by 205 centimetres high, it pairs our 90-centimetre handleless matt white barista station on the right with a 40-centimetre left-hand tower split horizontally at worktop height: an LED-illuminated black-framed smoked glass vitrine on top, and a solid matt white 18-millimetre MDF larder cupboard below.</p><p>This horizontal alignment across the entire 130-centimetre width creates an extraordinarily calm, architectural datum line. The bottom edge of the left-hand smoked glass door lines up cleanly with the worktop surface of the 90-centimetre preparation bay, while the solid white lower door of the left tower aligns with the handleless central drawer and twin lower doors of the main unit. Above, the black-framed smoked glass doors of the left column and the central overhead cabinet form a unified, glowing upper frieze. When you switch on the warm internal LED lighting, the upper half of the cabinet floats with warm amber light while the lower half grounds the room in crisp, serene matt white joinery.</p><p>Ergonomically, VELA 130 LEFT is a joy to use. The open preparation alcove on the right offers 86 centimetres of width, 43 centimetres of depth, and 65 centimetres of vertical headroom for your espresso machine and grinder. Built entirely from 18-millimetre Grade-A full MDF with damped soft-close hinges and telescopic drawer runners, its two modular sections (40 cm left half-vitrine + 90 cm barista unit) can be installed together as a cohesive 130-centimetre suite or separated to fit alcove walls on either side of a room.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>130 × 45 × 205 cm half-vitrine architectural suite aligning upper LED-lit black-framed smoked glass cabinets above a concealed matt white MDF base.</li><li>50/50 display-to-concealment ratio: three upper smoked glass doors at eye level paired with three solid 18 mm MDF lower cupboards and a wide drawer.</li><li>65 cm tall preparation alcove on the right wing with modular separable 40 cm left tower and handleless soft-close European hardware.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/duna-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated DUNA 90 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Sand Beige MDF</li><li>90 cm Compact</li><li>Smoked Glass Vitrine</li><li>Soft-Close Motion</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>90 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">86 × 43 cm worktop · 65 cm upper clearance · Soft-close runners</p><a href="/coffee-corners/duna-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-11">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-11" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-12">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
