ta-idx="9" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-10.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TERRA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" aria-label="TERRA 90 image 10"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-10.webp" alt="TERRA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="10" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-11.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TERRA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" aria-label="TERRA 90 image 11"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-12-duna-90-kum-beji-11.webp" alt="TERRA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Compact Single Module</span><span>EV–16</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">TERRA 90</a> <span>Sand Beige · Sleek Compact Module</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige full MDF · Black-framed smoked glass</p><p class="ev-desc">Transforms compact kitchen corners and dining room alcoves into an organised coffee bar with minimalist handle lines and a warm sand beige finish. Internal LED lighting within the smoked glass upper cabinet casts a soft evening ambience.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The Warm-Toned Gallery Column: TERRA 130 LEFT in Sand Beige with Full-Height Smoked Vitrine</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Combining the earthen tranquility of sand beige joinery with a floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass tower on the left wing, TERRA 130 LEFT turns a 130-centimetre dining or kitchen wall into an inviting, softly lit hospitality focal point.</p><p>There is a reason interior architects across London and the Home Counties increasingly specify warm sand-toned cabinetry alongside dark bronze and black-framed glass: it bridges the gap between period British architecture and modern minimalism. TERRA 130 LEFT captures that exact crossover. Spanning 130 centimetres wide by 205 centimetres high, it pairs our 90-centimetre sand beige handleless barista station on the right with a dramatic, full-height 40-centimetre smoked glass display column on the left. Against the soft, warm stone hue of the 18-millimetre full-MDF carcass, the slender black framing and tinted glass of the 205-centimetre left tower create a striking vertical silhouette that feels both contemporary and deeply welcoming.</p><p>When illuminated, the five internal display tiers of the left-hand smoked glass column and the two-door upper smoked glass bridge above the worktop cast a rich, golden-amber glow across the room. Because the interior carcass behind the smoked glass is finished in the same warm sand beige as the exterior, the light reflected through your crystal glassware, porcelain cups, and decanters feels extraordinarily soft and atmospheric—never clinical. Meanwhile, the right-hand open preparation bay provides 86 centimetres of width, 43 centimetres of depth, and 65 centimetres of vertical clearance, giving right-handed home baristas an unobstructed, ergonomic stage for pulling espresso shots and steaming milk.</p><p>Below the preparation surface, a full-width handleless drawer on damped telescopic steel runners keeps all brewing tools, filters, and capsules within an arm’s reach, while the double-door lower cupboard hides bulk provisions behind flush 18-millimetre sand beige MDF doors. Engineered as two precision-coupled modular units (40 cm full-height left vitrine + 90 cm barista station), TERRA 130 LEFT can be installed as a unified 130-centimetre suite or separated into an independent coffee bar and standalone display vitrine whenever your room layout demands.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>130 × 45 × 205 cm asymmetric left-tower suite in warm sand beige 18 mm full MDF with a 205 cm floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass vitrine.</li><li>Golden-warm LED illumination across five full-height vitrine shelves and the twin-door upper bridge cabinet above a 65 cm tall machine bay.</li><li>Handleless soft-close telescopic drawer, double-door concealed lower cupboard, and separable 40 + 90 cm modular full-MDF architecture.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated TERRA 90 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>90 cm Compact</li><li>Sand Beige MDF</li><li>Smoked Glass</li><li>Ambient LED</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>90 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">90 × 205 × 45 cm · 65 cm worktop vertical clearance</p><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-90-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-15">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-15" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-16">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
