view 12" aria-label="TERRA 130 LEFT image 12"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-17-terra-130-sol-kum-beji-12.webp" alt="TERRA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Left full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 12" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="12" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-17-terra-130-sol-kum-beji-13.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TERRA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Left full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" aria-label="TERRA 130 LEFT image 13"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-17-terra-130-sol-kum-beji-13.webp" alt="TERRA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Left full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="13" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-17-terra-130-sol-kum-beji-14.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TERRA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Left full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 14" aria-label="TERRA 130 LEFT image 14"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-17-terra-130-sol-kum-beji-14.webp" alt="TERRA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Left full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 14" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Left Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–17</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-130-left-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">TERRA 130 LEFT</a> <span>Sand Beige · Left Full-Height Glazed Vitrine</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige full MDF · Left full-height smoked glass vitrine</p><p class="ev-desc">Unites the warmth of a sand beige full-MDF carcass with a five-shelf full-height black smoked glass vitrine tower on the left wing. A wide telescopic soft-close drawer keeps coffee capsules, portafilters, and pour-over accessories close at hand.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Right-Handed Poise in Warm Stone &amp; Tinted Glass: The Architectural Story of TERRA 130 RIGHT</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Every room has a natural direction of approach. Where a kitchen island, breakfast table, or hallway entrance lies to the left of your wall, TERRA 130 RIGHT opens its warm sand beige barista worktop directly towards your hand whilst anchoring the far right corner with a 205-centimetre smoked glass tower.</p><p>Step into a well-resolved British kitchen-diner and you can feel immediately when the joinery respects the architecture of the room. If a tall vitrine is placed right beside a doorway on the left, it blocks the natural line of sight and forces you to reach past a glass door to make your morning coffee. TERRA 130 RIGHT eliminates that friction by positioning its open 90-centimetre preparation deck on the left wing and its floor-to-ceiling 40-centimetre black-framed smoked glass column on the right. As you walk in from the main kitchen area, the 86 by 43 centimetre espresso bay greets you immediately, while the full-height illuminated tower settles into the right-hand corner like a built-in architectural pillar.</p><p>The material palette of TERRA 130 RIGHT is a study in understated British warmth. Rather than stark white, the 18-millimetre Grade-A full-MDF carcass and handleless lower fascia are wrapped in a soothing sand beige finish inspired by honed Bath stone and warm travertine. Contrast comes from the razor-sharp black frames and dark smoked tempered glass of the upper bridge cabinet and the five-tier right-hand vitrine column. When the internal warm LED lighting is switched on, the sand beige interior reflects a gentle, honeyed light through the dark glass—turning your everyday collection of espresso cups, pour-over carafes, and crystal tumblers into an inviting evening display.</p><p>Beneath the 65-centimetre-high preparation bay, a full-width handleless drawer runs on damped telescopic steel slides, keeping heavy tampers, portafilters, digital scales, and tea tins neatly arranged and silent in operation. Below the drawer, twin solid sand beige MDF doors conceal bulk provisions, milk cartons, and larger cookware out of sight. Because the 90-centimetre station and the 40-centimetre right vitrine tower are constructed as independent, precision-mated 18-millimetre full-MDF modules, you can install them as one seamless 130-centimetre credenza or separate them into two distinct pieces of room architecture whenever you wish.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>130 × 45 × 205 cm right-vitrine architectural suite in warm sand beige 18 mm full MDF with a 205 cm floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass tower.</li><li>Open left-wing barista deck (86 × 43 cm net worktop, 65 cm vertical clearance) for effortless left-side approach from islands and doorways.</li><li>Five-tier LED-lit right glass column, twin-door upper smoked glass cabinet, damped telescopic drawer, and separable 90 + 40 cm modular build.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-130-left-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated TERRA 130 LEFT Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Left Full Vitrine</li><li>5-Shelf Tower</li><li>Sand Beige MDF</li><li>LED Illumination</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>130 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">Left 40 cm full-height glazed vitrine + 90 cm primary station</p><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-130-left-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-16">Qty