ull-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 12" aria-label="TERRA 130 RIGHT image 12"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-18-terra-130-sag-kum-beji-12.webp" alt="TERRA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Right full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 12" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="12" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-18-terra-130-sag-kum-beji-13.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TERRA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Right full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" aria-label="TERRA 130 RIGHT image 13"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-18-terra-130-sag-kum-beji-13.webp" alt="TERRA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Right full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="13" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-18-terra-130-sag-kum-beji-14.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TERRA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Right full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 14" aria-label="TERRA 130 RIGHT image 14"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-18-terra-130-sag-kum-beji-14.webp" alt="TERRA 130 RIGHT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Right full-height smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 14" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Right Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–18</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-130-right-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">TERRA 130 RIGHT</a> <span>Sand Beige · Right Full-Height Glazed Vitrine</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige full MDF · Right full-height smoked glass vitrine</p><p class="ev-desc">Features a full-height LED-lit smoked glass display tower on the right wing paired with a sand beige preparation module, creating a cohesive serving and display centrepiece for living rooms, dining spaces, and contemporary kitchens.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The Sand Beige &amp; Smoked Glass Credenza: TERRA 170 with Twin Half-Vitrine Towers</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">When a spacious dining room or open-plan living area calls for the symmetry of a 170-centimetre breakfront cabinet—yet demands that everyday household clutter remain hidden below waist height—TERRA 170 delivers the ideal balance of illuminated smoked glass and solid sand beige joinery.</p><p>Open-plan living has transformed the British dining wall. Where families once kept a low oak sideboard for Sunday china and a separate kitchen corner for the kettle, modern homes ask a single piece of architectural joinery to serve as morning barista bar, daytime larder, and evening drinks cabinet. Spanning 170 centimetres in width and standing 205 centimetres tall, TERRA 170 answers that three-part brief with quiet authority. Its 40 + 90 + 40 centimetre triad features twin half-vitrine outer columns and a central preparation bay, all dressed in a calm, stone-inspired sand beige 18-millimetre full-MDF finish that harmonises with warm timber floors and neutral plaster walls.</p><p>Notice how TERRA 170 divides its visual weight between display and concealment. Above the worktop horizon line, four black-framed smoked glass doors—flanking three-shelf vitrines on the left and right wings plus a twin-door bridge cabinet above the espresso machine—glow with warm internal LED lighting. Behind that dark tinted glass, your finest ceramics, espresso demitasses, and crystal stemware sit protected from dust while radiating a soft, lounge-like warmth across the room. Below the worktop datum, however, four solid sand beige handleless cupboard doors and a wide central drawer create an uninterrupted, grounded plinth that hides bulky bags of coffee beans, spare cartons of milk, table linens, and appliances completely from view.</p><p>At the heart of the suite, the 86-centimetre-wide by 43-centimetre-deep preparation deck offers a full 65 centimetres of vertical headroom—easily accommodating tall domestic espresso machines, conical burr grinders, and pour-over kettles without crowding. Every door and the full-width telescopic drawer operate on damped soft-close European hardware, while the modular three-column 18-millimetre full-MDF carcass allows the twin 40-centimetre side towers to be installed flush against the main unit or positioned independently on flanking walls.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>170 × 45 × 205 cm symmetrical twin half-vitrine hospitality credenza in sand beige 18 mm full MDF with four LED-lit black-framed smoked glass upper doors.</li><li>Grounded four-door solid sand beige lower base and full-width damped telescopic drawer conceal bulk household and kitchen provisions below waist level.</li><li>86 × 43 × 65 cm central barista bay with separable 40 + 90 + 40 cm modular full-MDF construction and handleless minimalist detailing.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-130-right-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated TERRA 130 RIGHT Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Right Full Vitrine</li><li>5-Shelf Tower</li><li>Sand Beige MDF</li><li>LED Illumination</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>130 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">Right 40 cm full-height glazed vitrine + 90 cm primary station</p><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-130-right-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-17">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-17" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-18">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
