loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="12" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-19-terra-170-kum-beji-13.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TERRA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Twin full-height smoked glass vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" aria-label="TERRA 170 image 13"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-19-terra-170-kum-beji-13.webp" alt="TERRA 170 (170 × 45 × 205 cm) Sand beige full MDF · Twin full-height smoked glass vitrines bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Sand Beige MDF · Twin Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–19</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-170-sand-beige/" class="ev-card-title-link">TERRA 170</a> <span>Sand Beige · Twin Full-Height Glazed Vitrines</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Sand beige full MDF · Twin full-height smoked glass vitrines</p><p class="ev-desc">One of the highest display-capacity designs in the collection, combining twin floor-to-ceiling illuminated smoked glass vitrine towers with a sand beige central barista station. Functions effortlessly as both a dining room sideboard and a complete home coffee bar.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Ten Illuminated Glass Tiers in Warm Stone: The Commanding Presence of TERRA 170 GRAND</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">For the collector of fine glassware, artisanal ceramics, and specialty coffee equipment who wants maximum vertical theatre in a warm, earthen palette, TERRA 170 GRAND pairs our sand beige 18-millimetre full-MDF carcass with twin floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass towers.</p><p>There are cabinets that blend quietly into a wall, and there are architectural centrepieces that define the entire mood of a room. TERRA 170 GRAND belongs unmistakably to the latter category. Stretching 170 centimetres across and rising 205 centimetres high, it frames a central 90-centimetre sand beige barista workbench between two floor-to-ceiling 40-centimetre black-framed smoked glass vitrine columns. Where pure white cabinets can sometimes feel cool in a living or dining room, the sand beige full-MDF carcass of TERRA 170 GRAND imbues the entire 170-centimetre expanse with a rich, organic warmth reminiscent of Milanese showroom joinery and Mayfair private members’ lounges.</p><p>When evening falls and the integrated warm LED illumination is switched on, the visual transformation is extraordinary. Each of the two outer 40-centimetre towers houses five full tiers of shelving behind single-piece, floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass doors, linked across the top by a twin-door smoked glass bridge cabinet. Because the interior panels behind the tinted glass are finished in warm sand beige, the LED light takes on a deep champagne glow—casting dramatic vertical reflections through crystal decanters, coupe glasses, porcelain espresso sets, and coffee canisters across twelve distinct display compartments.</p><p>Yet for all its evening glamour, TERRA 170 GRAND remains a supreme morning barista workstation. The central preparation bay offers 86 centimetres of width, 43 centimetres of depth, and 65 centimetres of vertical clearance for your espresso machine and grinder. Directly beneath the worktop, a full-width handleless drawer on damped telescopic steel slides organises tampers, knock boxes, scales, and pods, while the twin solid sand beige lower doors beneath the drawer provide a concealed larder for daily essentials. Built from 100% 18-millimetre Grade-A MDF in three separable modules (40 + 90 + 40 cm), it is engineered to last a lifetime.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>170 × 45 × 205 cm flagship grand credenza in warm sand beige 18 mm full MDF with twin floor-to-ceiling 205 cm black-framed smoked glass towers.</li><li>Twelve LED-illuminated smoked glass display compartments (5 left tower + 5 right tower + 2 upper bridge) with warm champagne-toned interior reflection.</li><li>Central 86 × 43 × 65 cm espresso deck above a full-width damped telescopic drawer, twin solid base cupboards, and separable 40+90+40 cm modules.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-170-sand-beige/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated TERRA 170 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Twin Full Vitrine</li><li>170 cm Grand Width</li><li>Sand Beige MDF</li><li>LED Illumination</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>170 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">40 + 90 + 40 cm twin full-height vitrine living &amp; kitchen bar</p><a href="/coffee-corners/terra-170-sand-beige/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-18">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-18" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-19">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
