"NATURA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="9" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-20-natura-90-ahsap-10.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="NATURA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" aria-label="NATURA 90 image 10"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-20-natura-90-ahsap-10.webp" alt="NATURA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 10" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="10" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-20-natura-90-ahsap-11.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="NATURA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" aria-label="NATURA 90 image 11"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-20-natura-90-ahsap-11.webp" alt="NATURA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 11" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="11" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-20-natura-90-ahsap-12.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="NATURA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 12" aria-label="NATURA 90 image 12"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-20-natura-90-ahsap-12.webp" alt="NATURA 90 (90 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 12" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Natural Oak Grain MDF · Compact Single Module</span><span>EV–20</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/natura-90-oak/" class="ev-card-title-link">NATURA 90</a> <span>Natural Oak Grain · Compact Module</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Natural timber-grain full MDF · Smoked glass upper vitrine</p><p class="ev-desc">Introduces organic timber warmth to British interiors with a natural oak-textured full-MDF carcass and smoked glass upper display cabinet. Its compact 90 cm width delivers a fully equipped coffee preparation station for smaller kitchen and living corners.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Organic Timber Grain &amp; Smoked Glass in 90 cm: NATURA 90 Compact Oak-Finish Coffee Station</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Sometimes a room craves the tactile honesty of natural wood grain rather than a painted or monochrome surface. NATURA 90 brings the organic warmth of vertically grained oak-finish 18-millimetre full MDF and LED-lit black-framed smoked glass into a compact 90-centimetre footprint.</p><p>Across British interior design—from Cotswold stone cottages and mid-century apartments in Hampstead to contemporary birch-and-oak extensions in Bristol—natural timber grain remains the ultimate antidote to grey winter light. NATURA 90 was crafted for homeowners who want their coffee station to feel like a piece of warm, architectural cabinetwork rather than a clinical kitchen appliance housing. Measuring a compact 90 centimetres wide by 45 centimetres deep and rising 205 centimetres high, every carcass panel, drawer front, lower door, and back panel is fabricated from 18-millimetre Grade-A full MDF clad in a continuous, fine-pored natural oak grain finish.</p><p>Look closely at the composition and you will see how the vertical timber grain flows seamlessly from the lower twin cupboard doors right up across the handleless drawer fascia and into the 65-centimetre-tall open preparation alcove. Crowning this warm timber base is a twin-door black-framed smoked glass vitrine illuminated by recessed warm LED lighting. The contrast between the dark tinted glass, the crisp matt black perimeter frame, and the golden-oak interior grain creates an atmosphere of immediate hygge and craft. When the LED strip illuminates your espresso machine and wooden tamper on the 86 by 43 centimetre worktop below, the entire corner of the room glows like an artisanal roastery.</p><p>In daily operation, NATURA 90 combines compact efficiency with heavyweight build quality. Because the substrate beneath the oak-grain surface is dense 18-millimetre full MDF rather than hollow chipboard, hinges stay true and the cabinet resists kitchen humidity year after year. The full-width central drawer glides silently on damped telescopic runners to store portafilters, paper filters, scales, and teaspoons, while the double-door lower cupboard conceals milk stocks, bean bags, and bulky items behind warm timber-grained doors.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Compact 90 × 45 × 205 cm single-module coffee corner in natural oak-grain 18 mm full MDF with an LED-lit black-framed smoked glass upper vitrine.</li><li>Continuous vertical timber-grain fascia across the handleless lower cupboards, damped telescopic drawer, and 86 × 43 × 65 cm barista alcove.</li><li>Moisture-resistant 18 mm Grade-A full-MDF construction pairing organic oak warmth with dark smoked tempered glass and soft-close hardware.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/natura-90-oak/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated NATURA 90 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Natural Oak Grain</li><li>90 cm Compact</li><li>Smoked Glass</li><li>LED Illumination</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>90 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">86 × 43 cm preparation worktop · Warm tactile timber grain</p><a href="/coffee-corners/natura-90-oak/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-19">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-19" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-20">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
