><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-21-natura-130-sol-ahsap-12.webp" alt="NATURA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Left smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 12" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="12" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-21-natura-130-sol-ahsap-13.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="NATURA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Left smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" aria-label="NATURA 130 LEFT image 13"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-21-natura-130-sol-ahsap-13.webp" alt="NATURA 130 LEFT (130 × 45 × 205 cm) Natural timber-grain full MDF · Left smoked glass vitrine bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 13" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Natural Oak Grain MDF · Left Glazed Vitrine</span><span>EV–21</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/natura-130-left-oak/" class="ev-card-title-link">NATURA 130 LEFT</a> <span>Natural Oak Grain · Left Glazed Vitrine</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Natural timber-grain full MDF · Left smoked glass vitrine</p><p class="ev-desc">A 130 cm modular coffee corner enriching a natural timber-textured MDF body with a left-hand smoked glass display tower and daylight LED illumination. Its separable two-piece modular structure allows effortless relocation and layout flexibility.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Mid-Century Timber Warmth Meets Modernist Glass: NATURA 130 LEFT Oak &amp; Smoked Vitrine Suite</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Pairing a floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass display tower on the left wing with a 90-centimetre natural oak-grain barista station on the right, NATURA 130 LEFT brings mid-century architectural warmth to British dining rooms and open-plan living spaces.</p><p>If you admire the architectural joinery of mid-century Scandinavian and British homes—where rich vertical timber panelling meets slender black steel and smoked glass—NATURA 130 LEFT will feel instantly familiar. Spanning 130 centimetres in width and rising 205 centimetres in height, it is a piece that belongs just as naturally in a carpeted drawing room or timber-floored dining area as it does in an open-plan kitchen. On the left wing stands a full-height 40-centimetre black-framed smoked glass display tower; on the right sits the 90-centimetre barista preparation module with its handleless oak-grain drawer, twin lower cupboard doors, and matching smoked glass upper bridge.</p><p>The interplay between the warm oak-grain 18-millimetre full-MDF carcass and the dark smoked tempered glass is deeply atmospheric. Inside the 205-centimetre left-hand vitrine tower, five full tiers of oak-grained shelving are bathed in warm integrated LED light. Through the dark tinted glass, the wood grain and your collection of ceramics, whisky tumblers, espresso cups, and glass decanters take on a rich, amber warmth that feels extraordinarily cosy on dark British evenings. Because the open 86 by 43 centimetre preparation bay sits on the right-hand side, right-handed coffee makers enjoy clear, unrestricted access to the espresso machine, grinder, and pouring kettle.</p><p>Every structural detail of NATURA 130 LEFT is engineered for permanence. Both the 40-centimetre full-height left vitrine and the 90-centimetre barista station are built from 100% 18-millimetre Grade-A MDF—never low-density particleboard—and fitted with damped soft-close hinges and full-extension telescopic drawer slides. Furthermore, because the two columns are precision-engineered as separable modular units, you can install them together as a 130-centimetre architectural suite or place the tall smoked-glass timber vitrine separately on an adjacent dining wall.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>130 × 45 × 205 cm asymmetric left-vitrine suite in natural oak-grain 18 mm full MDF with a 205 cm floor-to-ceiling black-framed smoked glass tower.</li><li>Warm LED illumination across five timber-backed vitrine tiers and the twin-door upper smoked glass bridge above a 65 cm tall preparation bay.</li><li>Handleless soft-close telescopic drawer, concealed oak-grain lower larder cupboard, and separable 40 + 90 cm modular full-MDF construction.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/natura-130-left-oak/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated NATURA 130 LEFT Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Natural Oak Grain</li><li>Left Glazed Vitrine</li><li>Detachable Tower</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>130 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>205 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">Left 40 cm detachable vitrine + 90 cm timber-grain station</p><a href="/coffee-corners/natura-130-left-oak/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-20">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-20" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-21">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
