rner — view 2" aria-label="TOSCANA 93 RAISED image 2"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-25-toscana-93-ayakli-02.webp" alt="TOSCANA 93 RAISED (93 × 45 × 210 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 2" width="1124" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="2" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-25-toscana-93-ayakli-03.webp" data-fit="cover" data-alt="TOSCANA 93 RAISED (93 × 45 × 210 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 3" aria-label="TOSCANA 93 RAISED image 3"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-25-toscana-93-ayakli-03.webp" alt="TOSCANA 93 RAISED (93 × 45 × 210 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 3" width="1124" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>White &amp; Timber Worktop · Integrated Dual Sockets</span><span>EV–25</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/toscana-93-raised/" class="ev-card-title-link">TOSCANA 93 RAISED</a> <span>Raised Legs · Dual Integrated Sockets</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop · Raised legs</p><p class="ev-desc">An elevated 2-door full-MDF coffee unit with raised legs for effortless floor and robot-vacuum cleaning, a warm timber-toned preparation alcove, touch-sensor LED illumination, and 2 integrated power sockets for high utility in compact kitchens.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Modern Handleless Purity Meets Warm Timber &amp; Built-In Power: The Story of TOSCANA 120</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">What if you love the warm contrast of a natural timber worktop against crisp matt white cabinetry—and you want the practical luxury of built-in power sockets and touch-sensor LED lighting—but your home calls for a cleaner, more contemporary silhouette? Enter TOSCANA 120.</p><p>Designed for modern British kitchen-diners where clean lines and multi-functional worktop space go hand in hand, TOSCANA 120 takes the celebrated 120 by 45 by 208 centimetre proportions of our mid-sized dresser architecture and refines every surface for contemporary family living. Its 18-millimetre Grade-A full-MDF carcass and membrane-wrapped doors are finished in a fresh, low-sheen matt white that brightens any wall, while the open central preparation bay is lined entirely in a warm, tactile natural timber finish across both the horizontal worktop and the vertical splashback panel.</p><p>Because a 120-centimetre-wide worktop gives you significantly more counter space than a 90-centimetre niche, TOSCANA 120 easily hosts an espresso machine, a dedicated burr grinder, a milk frother, and a kettle side by side with room to spare for a serving tray. Better still, powering those appliances is completely effortless: TOSCANA 120 comes equipped with two integrated flush-mounted electrical sockets right inside the preparation zone, paired with a touch-activated LED lighting system that washes warm task light across the wood-grained splashback at the tap of a finger. Above the worktop, three glazed upper doors keep six compartments of cups, glasses, and coffee jars visible yet shielded from kitchen steam.</p><p>Storage beneath the timber worktop is organised with Swiss-watch logic. Twin side-by-side damped telescopic drawers glide open smoothly to store capsules, filters, tampers, tea caddies, and table linens, while the three panelled lower cupboard doors conceal deep 18-millimetre full-MDF larder shelving for bulk provisions, small kitchen appliances, and extra crockery. It is a self-contained 120-centimetre culinary and barista hub built to serve busy British households from dawn until midnight.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>120 × 45 × 208 cm contemporary two-tone coffee &amp; kitchen station in matt white 18 mm membrane MDF with warm timber worktop and splashback.</li><li>Integrated dual power sockets and touch-sensor LED worktop illumination built directly into the 120 cm wide preparation bay.</li><li>Three glazed upper display doors, twin side-by-side damped telescopic drawers, and three deep lower larder cupboards in 100% 18 mm full MDF.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/toscana-93-raised/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated TOSCANA 93 RAISED Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Raised Legs</li><li>2 Integrated Sockets</li><li>Touch-Sensor LED</li><li>18 mm Full MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>93 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>210 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">Robot-vacuum friendly raised legs · 2 integrated power sockets</p><a href="/coffee-corners/toscana-93-raised/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-24">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-24" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-25">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
