ANA 140 image 2"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-02.webp" alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 2" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="2" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-03.webp" data-fit="cover" data-alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 3" aria-label="TOSCANA 140 image 3"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-03.webp" alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 3" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="3" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-04.webp" data-fit="cover" data-alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 4" aria-label="TOSCANA 140 image 4"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-04.webp" alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 4" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="4" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-05.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 5" aria-label="TOSCANA 140 image 5"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-05.webp" alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 5" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="5" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-06.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" aria-label="TOSCANA 140 image 6"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-06.webp" alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="6" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-07.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" aria-label="TOSCANA 140 image 7"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-26-toscana-140-07.webp" alt="TOSCANA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>White &amp; Timber Worktop · Integrated Dual Sockets</span><span>EV–26</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/toscana-140/" class="ev-card-title-link">TOSCANA 140</a> <span>4-Door Wide Worktop · Dual Integrated Sockets</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white membrane MDF · Warm timber worktop &amp; splashback</p><p class="ev-desc">Offers an uninterrupted 140 cm wide preparation worktop to position espresso machines, grinders, and companion kitchen appliances side by side. Complete with 4 glazed upper doors, twin soft-close drawers, a 4-door lower larder, and 2 integrated power sockets.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The 140 cm Four-Door Culinary &amp; Barista Command Centre: TOSCANA 140 with Dual Integrated Sockets</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">For busy family kitchens where the coffee corner also serves as the breakfast bar and secondary appliance bay, TOSCANA 140 expands our two-tone timber-and-white architecture to an expansive 140 centimetres with four glazed upper doors, two wide drawers, and built-in dual power sockets.</p><p>In many British homes, the main kitchen worktop is constantly under siege from breakfast preparation, school lunchboxes, and evening cooking. TOSCANA 140 was engineered to liberate your kitchen counters by creating a dedicated, self-powered 140-centimetre hospitality and breakfast station. Standing 208 centimetres high and 45 centimetres deep, its uninterrupted 140-centimetre warm timber-finish worktop is wide enough to house a full espresso machine and grinder suite on one side and a microwave, air fryer, or Artisan stand mixer on the other—without the two zones ever feeling crowded.</p><p>To make that multi-appliance setup genuinely practical, TOSCANA 140 integrates two flush-mounted power sockets directly into the cabinet alongside a touch-sensor LED lighting bar recessed beneath the upper pelmet. One touch illuminates the entire 140-centimetre wood-grained back panel in warm, glare-free light, turning morning coffee and late-night tea preparation into a calm, well-lit pleasure. Above the 41.5-centimetre-high preparation bay, a four-door clear-glazed upper cabinet creates an impressive horizontal display gallery for everyday mugs, wine glasses, cafetières, and stoneware bowls.</p><p>Beneath the timber worktop, the storage volume of TOSCANA 140 is extraordinary. Two wide, symmetrical drawers on heavy-duty damped telescopic runners span the full 140-centimetre width, giving you cavernous waist-high organisation for coffee pods, barista tools, cutlery, and linens. Below those drawers, four classical shaker-profiled lower doors—crafted, like the entire carcass, from 18-millimetre Grade-A membrane MDF rather than chipboard—open to reveal a four-bay larder capable of storing an entire household’s dry groceries, drinks stocks, and bulky cookware.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Expansive 140 × 45 × 208 cm four-door two-tone barista &amp; breakfast dresser in matt white 18 mm membrane MDF with a 140 cm warm timber worktop.</li><li>Equipped with 2 integrated flush-mounted power sockets and touch-sensor LED task lighting across the full 140 cm preparation alcove.</li><li>Four glazed upper cupboard doors, two extra-wide damped telescopic drawers, and four enclosed lower larder doors with antique-toned cup handles.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/toscana-140/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated TOSCANA 140 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>140 cm Wide Worktop</li><li>2 Integrated Sockets</li><li>Twin Drawers</li><li>Membrane MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>140 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>208 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">140 cm continuous wide worktop · 2 integrated sockets · Twin drawers</p><a href="/coffee-corners/toscana-140/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-25">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-25" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-26">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
