5" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-27-ionia-93-06.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="IONIA 93 (93 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" aria-label="IONIA 93 image 6"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-27-ionia-93-06.webp" alt="IONIA 93 (93 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="6" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-27-ionia-93-07.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="IONIA 93 (93 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" aria-label="IONIA 93 image 7"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-27-ionia-93-07.webp" alt="IONIA 93 (93 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="7" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-27-ionia-93-08.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="IONIA 93 (93 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" aria-label="IONIA 93 image 8"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-27-ionia-93-08.webp" alt="IONIA 93 (93 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>White &amp; Timber Worktop · Compact Single Module</span><span>EV–27</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/ionia-93/" class="ev-card-title-link">IONIA 93</a> <span>Fluted Reeded Doors · Arched Glazed Top</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove</p><p class="ev-desc">Interprets classic British country-modern joinery within a compact 93 cm footprint, pairing vertically reeded lower cupboard doors with arched upper glass panes and a warm timber-toned preparation worktop in 18 mm full MDF.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Classic Two-Tone Proportion in 93 Centimetres: VERONA 93 PLINTH with 61 cm Tall Timber Alcove</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">When you have a compact 93-centimetre kitchen alcove or dining corner, yet you use a tall bean-to-cup coffee machine or top-loading espresso grinder that demands generous vertical headroom, VERONA 93 PLINTH pairs a 61-centimetre-high warm timber alcove with a grounded plinth base.</p><p>One of the most common pitfalls when buying a compact coffee cabinet is overlooking vertical alcove clearance: many domestic espresso machines require you to lift a top lid to pour in whole beans or extract a tall water reservoir from above. VERONA 93 PLINTH solves this effortlessly within a trim 93 by 45 centimetre floor footprint. Standing 208 centimetres tall on a solid, dust-sealing floor plinth, it dedicates a full 61 centimetres of vertical clearance to its open preparation bay—lined across both worktop and full back panel in a rich, warm natural timber finish that contrasts beautifully against the matt white 18-millimetre full-MDF carcass.</p><p>That warm timber alcove acts as a natural picture frame for your coffee equipment. Recessed beneath the upper cabinet, integrated LED task lighting casts a soft, inviting glow down the wood-grained splashback and across the 45-centimetre-deep worktop, while a neatly machined rear cable management port allows appliance plugs to pass cleanly out of sight without kinking cords against the wall. Above the alcove, twin clear-glazed shaker-profiled doors let you see your collection of porcelain cups, tea tins, and glassware at a glance while keeping them sheltered from airborne kitchen steam.</p><p>Below the timber worktop, VERONA 93 PLINTH features a full-width drawer running on smooth, damped telescopic steel runners and accented with classic dark cup handles—ideal for storing tampers, coffee scoops, capsules, and napkins at waist height. Beneath the drawer, twin panelled lower doors open to a deep two-tier base cupboard built from 100% 18-millimetre Grade-A MDF. Because the cabinet sits flush to the floor on an architectural plinth, dust and stray coffee beans can never roll underneath, keeping daily kitchen maintenance effortless.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>Compact 93 × 45 × 208 cm floor-plinth coffee station combining matt white 18 mm full MDF with a warm timber-finish worktop and splashback.</li><li>Extra-generous 61 cm vertical alcove clearance with integrated LED task lighting and a rear cable management port for tidy appliance wiring.</li><li>Twin clear-glazed upper display doors, full-width damped telescopic accessory drawer, and double-door lower larder on a dust-sealed plinth base.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/ionia-93/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated IONIA 93 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Reeded Lower Doors</li><li>Arched Glazed Top</li><li>93 cm Compact</li><li>Membrane MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>93 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>208 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">61 cm worktop vertical clearance · Soft-close hydraulic hinges</p><a href="/coffee-corners/ionia-93/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-26">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-26" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-27">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
