utton type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="5" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-28-ionia-140-06.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="IONIA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" aria-label="IONIA 140 image 6"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-28-ionia-140-06.webp" alt="IONIA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="6" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-28-ionia-140-07.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="IONIA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" aria-label="IONIA 140 image 7"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-28-ionia-140-07.webp" alt="IONIA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="7" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-28-ionia-140-08.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="IONIA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" aria-label="IONIA 140 image 8"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-28-ionia-140-08.webp" alt="IONIA 140 (140 × 45 × 208 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>White &amp; Timber Worktop · Integrated Dual Sockets</span><span>EV–28</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/ionia-140/" class="ev-card-title-link">IONIA 140</a> <span>4-Bay Reeded Joinery · Wide Timber Alcove</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white membrane MDF · Vertical reeded doors &amp; timber alcove</p><p class="ev-desc">Configured as both a dedicated home coffee bar and an elegant dining room dresser, featuring four arched glazed upper cabinet doors, a touch-sensor LED-illuminated warm timber preparation alcove, and wide vertically reeded base cupboards.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Airy Freestanding Elegance on Raised Legs: VERONA 93 RAISED Two-Tone Barista Cabinet</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">In smaller British dining rooms, period kitchens with deep skirting boards, or apartments with underfloor heating and robot vacuums, lifting a cabinet onto slender raised legs changes the entire spatial feel of a room. That is the architectural secret behind VERONA 93 RAISED.</p><p>Interior designers have a golden rule for compact rooms: the more floor surface remains visible beneath a piece of furniture, the larger the room appears to the human eye. Measuring 93 centimetres wide by 45 centimetres deep and rising 210 centimetres high, VERONA 93 RAISED takes our beloved two-tone matt white and warm timber coffee station and elevates it on sturdy, tapered raised legs. Not only does this give the cabinet the poised, freestanding charm of a bespoke British larder armoire, it also provides generous clearance underneath for effortless mopping, air circulation over timber floors, and modern robotic vacuum cleaners.</p><p>At the centre of VERONA 93 RAISED sits a warm, wood-grained preparation alcove that feels immediately welcoming. Offering a full 61 centimetres of vertical headroom and 45 centimetres of depth, the timber-finish worktop easily accommodates a domestic espresso machine, burr grinder, and gooseneck kettle simultaneously. Integrated LED lighting recessed beneath the upper cabinet bathes the wood-grained back panel in warm light, while a dedicated rear cable port channels power leads neatly behind the unit. Above, twin clear-glazed shaker doors showcase your favourite cups, cafetières, and glassware across two internal tiers.</p><p>Every panel of VERONA 93 RAISED—from the 18-millimetre Grade-A full-MDF carcass to the moulded shaker doors and drawer front—is built for long-term structural rigidity. Below the timber worktop, a full-width drawer on damped telescopic runners keeps barista tools, filters, and pods right under your hand, while the double-door lower cupboard conceals bulk coffee bags, milk cartons, and serving pieces behind crisp matt white doors accented with classic cup ironmongery.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>93 × 45 × 210 cm freestanding two-tone coffee armoire on raised legs—creating an airy visual footprint and easy under-cabinet floor cleaning.</li><li>61 cm tall warm timber-lined preparation alcove with integrated LED lighting and rear cable management port inside a matt white 18 mm MDF body.</li><li>Twin clear-glazed upper doors, full-width damped telescopic drawer, and double-door concealed base cupboard with traditional cup handles.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/ionia-140/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated IONIA 140 Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>140 cm Wide Span</li><li>Touch-Sensor LED</li><li>Twin Drawers</li><li>Membrane MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>140 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>208 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">140 × 45 cm wide worktop · Touch-sensor daylight LED illumination</p><a href="/coffee-corners/ionia-140/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-27">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-27" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></b