att white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 5" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="5" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-29-fiore-140-ayakli-06.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="FIORE 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 213 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" aria-label="FIORE 140 RAISED image 6"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-29-fiore-140-ayakli-06.webp" alt="FIORE 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 213 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="6" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-29-fiore-140-ayakli-07.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="FIORE 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 213 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" aria-label="FIORE 140 RAISED image 7"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-29-fiore-140-ayakli-07.webp" alt="FIORE 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 213 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="7" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-29-fiore-140-ayakli-08.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="FIORE 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 213 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" aria-label="FIORE 140 RAISED image 8"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-29-fiore-140-ayakli-08.webp" alt="FIORE 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 213 cm) Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 8" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>White &amp; Timber Worktop · Raised Timber Legs</span><span>EV–29</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/fiore-140-raised/" class="ev-card-title-link">FIORE 140 RAISED</a> <span>Arched Relief Doors · 15 cm Timber Legs</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Matt white membrane MDF · Timber worktop &amp; 15 cm raised legs</p><p class="ev-desc">Presents an airy architectural silhouette through matching arched motifs repeated across both the upper glazed doors and lower membrane doors, elevated on 15 cm timber-toned legs and fitted with touch-sensor LED task lighting and soft-close drawers.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The Freestanding 140 cm Country-Modern Credenza: VERONA 140 RAISED with Dual Integrated Sockets</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Uniting the freestanding elegance of raised legs, the warmth of a 140-centimetre timber worktop, touch-sensor LED lighting, and two built-in power sockets, VERONA 140 RAISED is the ultimate freestanding two-tone hospitality dresser for open-plan British kitchen-diners.</p><p>When you want a wide, high-capacity 140-centimetre coffee and breakfast dresser that looks like a piece of fine freestanding furniture rather than a static block of fitted kitchen units, VERONA 140 RAISED is in a class of its own. Standing 210 centimetres tall by 140 centimetres wide and 45 centimetres deep, its entire 18-millimetre Grade-A membrane MDF carcass is lifted cleanly off the floor on raised architectural legs. That subtle elevation lets natural daylight and timber flooring flow uninterrupted beneath the cabinet, preventing the 140-centimetre span from ever overwhelming a medium-sized dining room or kitchen wall.</p><p>Across the middle of the cabinet runs an expansive 140-centimetre warm timber-finish worktop and matching wood-grained splashback equipped for serious daily work. Instead of hunting for wall sockets behind the cabinet, you simply plug your espresso machine, grinder, kettle, or toaster directly into the two flush-mounted power sockets integrated into the station. A gentle tap on the touch-sensor switch activates the recessed LED lighting bar, washing warm daylight illumination across the timber back panel and your preparation surface. Above the alcove, four clear-glazed shaker-profiled doors provide a wide, dust-free showcase for porcelain, glassware, and tea caddies.</p><p>Beneath the 140-centimetre timber worktop, twin side-by-side drawers glide on damped telescopic steel runners, giving you separate, silent compartments for coffee accessories, cutlery, and table linens. Below the drawers, four panelled matt white lower cupboard doors—finished with classic dark cup handles—open to reveal a vast four-door larder crafted entirely from moisture-resistant 18-millimetre full MDF. It is freestanding British hospitality joinery at its most capable.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>140 × 45 × 210 cm freestanding four-door two-tone dresser on raised legs in matt white 18 mm membrane MDF with a warm timber worktop and splashback.</li><li>2 integrated flush-mounted electrical sockets and touch-sensor LED task lighting built directly into the 140 cm preparation bay.</li><li>Four clear-glazed upper doors, two wide damped telescopic drawers, and four panelled lower larder cupboards with easy under-cabinet floor clearance.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/fiore-140-raised/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated FIORE 140 RAISED Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>15 cm Raised Legs</li><li>Arched Membrane</li><li>Touch-Sensor LED</li><li>140 cm Wide Span</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>140 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>213 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">213 cm total height · 15 cm raised legs · Touch-sensor LED</p><a href="/coffee-corners/fiore-140-raised/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-28">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-28" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-29">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
