ome coffee corner — view 9" aria-label="BIANCA 93 PLINTH image 9"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-30-bianca-93-bazali-09.webp" alt="BIANCA 93 PLINTH (93 × 45 × 208 cm) Pure white full MDF · Contrast matt black cup handles bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Matt White MDF · Compact Single Module</span><span>EV–30</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-93-plinth/" class="ev-card-title-link">BIANCA 93 PLINTH</a> <span>Pure White Carcass · Matt Black Cup Handles</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Pure white full MDF · Contrast matt black cup handles</p><p class="ev-desc">Blends seamlessly into bright British kitchens with an all-white full-MDF carcass, clear-glazed upper cup cabinet, and contrasting matt black cup handles. A 61 cm tall worktop alcove and integrated cable management port keep the work surface clutter-free.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Pure Monochrome Shaker Serenity: BIANCA 93 PLINTH All-White Full-MDF Coffee Station</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">For British kitchens where a pure, uninterrupted all-white palette is essential—and where contrasting matt black cup handles provide just the right nod to classic Shaker scullery heritage—BIANCA 93 PLINTH delivers a crisp 93-centimetre barista station on a grounded floor plinth.</p><p>Not every white kitchen wants the warm interruption of a timber worktop. In classic all-white Shaker kitchens, marble-worktop sculleries, or bright coastal and townhouse interiors, a seamless monochrome white cabinet feels far more harmonious. BIANCA 93 PLINTH was designed specifically for these spaces. Measuring 93 centimetres wide by 45 centimetres deep and standing 208 centimetres high on a flush architectural plinth, every surface—from the 18-millimetre Grade-A full-MDF carcass and worktop deck to the moulded shaker doors and 61-centimetre-tall back panel—is finished in a uniform, serene pure matt white.</p><p>Against this crisp white architecture, the matt black cup handles and upper door knobs act like fine pen-and-ink details on heavy cotton paper. Step up to the open preparation alcove and you will appreciate how spacious a 61-centimetre vertical clearance feels: even tall espresso machines with top-warming cup trays and large conical burr grinders sit comfortably beneath the upper cabinet with ample room to refill water tanks and bean hoppers. Integrated LED task lighting recessed into the underside of the upper cupboard bathes the all-white alcove in bright, shadow-free light, while a neat rear cable management port routes appliance cords cleanly out of sight.</p><p>Above the preparation bay, twin clear-glazed shaker doors display your finest porcelain mugs, glassware, and coffee canisters across two internal shelves while keeping them spotless. Below the worktop, a full-width drawer on damped telescopic steel slides houses tampers, portafilters, capsules, and teaspoons, while the double-door lower larder cupboard conceals bulk groceries and spare appliances behind solid 18-millimetre full-MDF doors.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>93 × 45 × 208 cm all-white monochrome Shaker coffee corner in 18 mm Grade-A full MDF with contrasting matt black cup handles on a floor plinth.</li><li>Tall 61 cm vertical preparation alcove clearance with integrated LED worktop illumination and a rear cable port for clutter-free wiring.</li><li>Twin clear-glazed upper display doors, full-width damped telescopic drawer, and double-door lower larder cupboard in moisture-resistant full MDF.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-93-plinth/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated BIANCA 93 PLINTH Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Pure White MDF</li><li>61 cm Clearance</li><li>LED Illumination</li><li>Cable Port</li></ul><div class