 coffee corner — view 9" aria-label="BIANCA 93 RAISED image 9"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-31-bianca-93-ayakli-09.webp" alt="BIANCA 93 RAISED (93 × 45 × 210 cm) Pure white full MDF · Black cup handles · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 9" width="1126" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Matt White MDF · Raised Timber Legs</span><span>EV–31</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-93-raised/" class="ev-card-title-link">BIANCA 93 RAISED</a> <span>Raised Legs · Pure White Full MDF</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Pure white full MDF · Black cup handles · Raised legs</p><p class="ev-desc">Lifts a crisp all-white 93 cm coffee cabinet off the floor on slender raised legs. Featuring twin clear-glazed upper doors, LED worktop illumination, a full-width central drawer, and a two-door lower cupboard for an airy presence in compact rooms.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>Crisp White Freestanding Poise: BIANCA 93 RAISED All-White Armoire on Raised Legs</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Taking our pure all-white monochrome Shaker coffee station and lifting it onto slender raised legs, BIANCA 93 RAISED brings an airy, freestanding furniture presence to compact British kitchens, breakfast rooms, and apartment dining corners.</p><p>When you are furnishing a compact kitchen-diner or a period room with original floorboards and high skirting, a freestanding armoire on legs often looks far more graceful than a plinth-mounted unit. Measuring 93 centimetres wide by 45 centimetres deep and rising 210 centimetres high, BIANCA 93 RAISED elevates its crisp, pure white 18-millimetre full-MDF silhouette on tapered raised legs. The visual effect is immediate: light passes beneath the base, your flooring remains visible right to the wall, and cleaning underneath—whether with a mop or a robotic vacuum—takes seconds.</p><p>From top to bottom, BIANCA 93 RAISED celebrates the timeless clarity of pure white British Shaker joinery punctuated by matt black cup pulls and knobs. The central preparation bay offers a full 61 centimetres of vertical clearance across its 93 by 45 centimetre deck, giving tall bean-to-cup machines, espresso makers, and pouring kettles generous breathing room. Switched on, the integrated LED lighting beneath the upper cupboard reflects off the pure white back panel and worktop to create a bright, uplifting morning coffee stage, while the rear cable management port keeps electrical leads neatly tucked away.</p><p>Above the worktop, twin clear-glazed doors allow your favourite ceramics, glassware, and tea tins to shine behind glass while remaining completely shielded from cooking vapour and household dust. Below the worktop, a full-width drawer glides silently on damped telescopic steel runners to organise barista tools, filters, dosing scales, and espresso pods at comfortable waist height, while the two panelled lower cupboard doors conceal bulk provisions, oat milk cartons, and larger serving pieces inside a rock-solid 18-millimetre Grade-A full-MDF carcass built for decades of daily service in British homes.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>93 × 45 × 210 cm freestanding all-white Shaker coffee station on raised legs—combining an airy footprint with effortless under-cabinet cleaning.</li><li>61 cm vertical alcove clearance in pure white 18 mm full MDF with integrated LED worktop lighting, rear cable port, and matt black cup ironmongery.</li><li>Twin clear-glazed upper display doors, full-width damped telescopic drawer, and double-door concealed base cupboard.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-93-raised/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated BIANCA 93 RAISED Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>Raised Legs</li><li>Pure White MDF</li><li>LED Illumination</li><li>93 cm Compact</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>93 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>210 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">93 × 210 × 45 cm · Raised legs for easy under-cabinet cleaning</p><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-93-raised/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-30">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-30" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-31">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
