idth="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="5" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-32-bianca-140-ayakli-06.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="BIANCA 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 210 cm) Pure white membrane MDF · Black handles · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" aria-label="BIANCA 140 RAISED image 6"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-32-bianca-140-ayakli-06.webp" alt="BIANCA 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 210 cm) Pure white membrane MDF · Black handles · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 6" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button><button type="button" class="ev-thumb" data-idx="6" data-src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-32-bianca-140-ayakli-07.webp" data-fit="contain" data-alt="BIANCA 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 210 cm) Pure white membrane MDF · Black handles · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" aria-label="BIANCA 140 RAISED image 7"><img src="/assets/kk-evsel/kk-ev-32-bianca-140-ayakli-07.webp" alt="BIANCA 140 RAISED (140 × 45 × 210 cm) Pure white membrane MDF · Black handles · Raised legs bespoke MDF home coffee corner — view 7" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></button></div><div class="ev-body"><div class="ev-meta"><span>Matt White MDF · Integrated Dual Sockets</span><span>EV–32</span></div><h3><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-140-raised/" class="ev-card-title-link">BIANCA 140 RAISED</a> <span>4-Door Raised Legs · Dual Integrated Sockets</span></h3><p class="ev-finish">Pure white membrane MDF · Black handles · Raised legs</p><p class="ev-desc">Unites a generous 140 cm all-white MDF carcass, raised legs, touch-sensor LED worktop lighting, and 2 integrated power sockets in one cohesive design. Its twin-drawer, four-door layout makes it ideal for busy family kitchens and open-plan dining spaces.</p><details class="ev-story-drawer"><summary>Read Bespoke Architectural Story &amp; Monograph ▾</summary><div class="ev-story-content"><h4>The Flagship All-White 140 cm Freestanding Barista Dresser: BIANCA 140 RAISED with Dual Sockets</h4><p class="ev-story-lead">Crowning our collection at number thirty-two, BIANCA 140 RAISED unites an expansive 140-centimetre pure white membrane-MDF carcass, freestanding raised legs, touch-sensor LED lighting, and two built-in power sockets into the ultimate monochrome British kitchen-diner centrepiece.</p><p>For homeowners who adore the bright, architectural calm of an all-white British kitchen or dining room—yet demand the full 140-centimetre width and multi-appliance power of a grand hospitality dresser—BIANCA 140 RAISED is the definitive choice. Spanning 140 centimetres wide by 45 centimetres deep and standing 210 centimetres tall on raised architectural legs, it offers the storage capacity of a four-door butler’s pantry while maintaining the light, poised footprint of freestanding furniture. Every carcass panel, shelf, drawer front, and shaker-profiled door is crafted from 18-millimetre Grade-A membrane MDF in pure matt white, accented by crisp matt black cup handles and knobs.</p><p>The 140-centimetre-wide open preparation bay is engineered to handle the busiest morning rush and the largest weekend dinner party alike. With two flush-mounted electrical sockets built directly into the cabinet and a touch-sensor LED task lighting bar recessed overhead, you can run a dual-boiler espresso machine, a dedicated grinder, and a kettle or microwave side by side without a single trailing extension cable. One tap on the touch sensor bathes the entire 140-centimetre pure white alcove in crisp, shadow-free daylight illumination. Above the worktop, four clear-glazed shaker doors showcase your porcelain, crystal stemware, and specialty coffee jars across an expansive glass gallery.</p><p>Beneath the 140-centimetre worktop, two wide, symmetrical drawers on damped telescopic steel runners provide effortless waist-high storage for portafilters, tampers, coffee capsules, cutlery, and linens. Below the twin drawers, four panelled lower cupboard doors open to reveal a full-width four-bay larder—while the raised legs underneath allow air, light, and robot vacuums to pass freely beneath the entire 140-centimetre suite.</p><ul class="ev-story-highlights"><li>140 × 45 × 210 cm flagship freestanding all-white four-door coffee &amp; kitchen dresser on raised legs in 18 mm Grade-A membrane MDF.</li><li>Equipped with 2 integrated flush-mounted power sockets and touch-sensor LED worktop lighting across the uninterrupted 140 cm preparation bay.</li><li>Four clear-glazed upper display doors, two wide damped telescopic drawers, and four panelled lower larder cupboards with matt black cup handles.</li></ul><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-140-raised/" class="ev-story-page-link">Open Dedicated BIANCA 140 RAISED Product Page →</a></div></details><ul class="ev-badges"><li>140 cm Raised Legs</li><li>2 Integrated Sockets</li><li>Touch-Sensor LED</li><li>Membrane MDF</li></ul><div class="ev-dims"><div><small>Width</small><b>140 cm</b></div><div><small>Depth</small><b>45 cm</b></div><div><small>Height</small><b>210 cm</b></div></div><p class="ev-counter-note">140 × 210 × 45 cm · 2 integrated power sockets · Touch-sensor LED</p><a href="/coffee-corners/bianca-140-raised/" class="ev-detail-page-btn">View Full Product Story &amp; Specifications →</a><div class="ev-actions"><div><label for="ev-q-31">Qty</label><input id="ev-q-31" class="ev-qty" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric"/></div><button type="button" class="ev-add">Add to Quote List <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div><button type="button" class="ev-direct ev-card-wa-btn" data-card-id="ev-ev-32">Add &amp; Send Quote via WhatsApp (+44 7898 262110) ↗</button></div></article>
